{"c":[{"name":"20261002T143157Z-fc39a0364b9ecb3f","text":"Pattern gate runs on the event path: no SQLite writes there (one decision-log insert stalled 11 ms at load 15-69); decisions are buffered and flushed on tick.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T160236Z-60fc41a933501ea6","text":"A --background-only (prohibited) caret-fixture reports no key window, yet stdin 'focus NAME' (makeKey + makeFirstResponder) still moves AX focus; the reader sees leave and focus walks.","type":"note"}]}
